==== hyperbricks yaml {!{page}} ====
base_card:
  - type: template
  - template: "{{TEMPLATE:cards/card.html}}"
  - values:
      title: Base title
      body: Base body
      width: 320
      theme:
        tone: neutral
        density: compact

page:
  - type: hypermedia
  - route: inheritance-override

  - featured_card:
      - inherit: base_card
      - values:
          title: Overridden title
          theme:
            tone: strong
==== explainer ====
inherit deep-copies a named object and recursively merges local value overrides without moving the child.
==== expected json ====
{
  "@order": [
    "featured_card"
  ],
  "@type": "<HYPERMEDIA>",
  "featured_card": {
    "@type": "<TEMPLATE>",
    "template": "{{TEMPLATE:cards/card.html}}",
    "values": {
      "body": "Base body",
      "theme": {
        "density": "compact",
        "tone": "strong"
      },
      "title": "Overridden title",
      "width": "320"
    }
  },
  "route": "inheritance-override"
}
==== expected output ====
<!DOCTYPE html><html><body><article><h2>Overridden title</h2><p>Base body</p><span>strong</span></article></body></html>
